@startuml
title VibeGraph Domain Model

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide methods

class User {
  id: string
  createdAt: timestamp
}

class Playlist {
  id: string
  name: string
  trackCount: int
  artwork: string?
  createdAt: timestamp
}

class Track {
  id: string
  title: string
  artist: string
  genre: string
  albumArt: string?
}

class Artist {
  name: string
}

class Genre {
  name: string
}

class TasteAnalysis {
  topArtists: list
  topGenres: list
  detectedTaste: list<string>
  moodTags: list<string>
}

class RecommendedTrack {
  id: string
  title: string
  artist: string
  genre: string
  score: float
  graphPath: string
  reason: string
}

class AgentExplanation {
  playlistName: string
  explanation: string
  tracks: list<RecommendedTrack>
}

User "1" --> "0..*" Playlist : OWNS
Playlist "1" --> "0..*" Track : CONTAINS
Track "0..*" --> "1" Artist : BY
Track "0..*" --> "1" Genre : HAS_GENRE
Artist "0..*" --> "0..*" Genre : HAS_GENRE

User ..> TasteAnalysis : analyzed from graph
User ..> RecommendedTrack : receives
RecommendedTrack ..> AgentExplanation : enriched by LLM

note right of Artist
  확장 후보:
  Artist -[:SIMILAR_TO]-> Artist
  외부 API 또는 임베딩 기반으로 생성
end note

note bottom of RecommendedTrack
  graphPath는 추천 설명 가능성을 위한 핵심 필드.
  예: User -> Playlist -> Track -> Genre[Pop] -> Candidate
end note

@enduml
